    "notes": "Config from the checkpoint: filters are scipy butter(order 5) + sosfiltfilt at 250 Hz, then standardize over (lead, time). The framework filters before resampling (500 Hz), which keeps the same passband. Lead II only (spec 2026-10-07). Class order none, P, QRS, T from the repo's label convention (unverified against a labelled record). License conflict: LICENSE Apache-2.0, README all rights reserved."
